.Dd November 11, 2026
.Dt EVQ_CREATE 2
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm evq_create
.Nd create an event queue
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Fn evq_create flags
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm creates a wait-for-many queue.  The only defined value of
.Fa flags
is zero.  The returned handle has read, write and duplicate rights.
.Sh ERRORS
.Bl -tag -width Er
.It Er EINVAL
.Fa flags was nonzero.
.It Er EMFILE
The process handle table is full.
.El
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD ABI v1.
